  "bio": "Saids Designs is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in minimalist and fineline styles, offering their expertise in the serene setting of La Orotava, Spain. Clients seeking a sleek, contemporary ink design will find Saids Designs' portfolio both impressive and indicative of their craftsmanship. Operating out of Tenerife in the quaint Valle San Lorenzo, this artist's hours allow for flexible scheduling to accommodate the creation of meticulously rendered tattoos.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: La Orotava, Canary Islands, Spain\n\n• 𝑻𝒆𝒏𝒆𝒓𝒊𝒇𝒆\n• Profesor Oficial de @cursoscente (@carloss.zb) \n• 𝐕𝐈𝐏 Service (Discreción para Famosos)\n• Para Citas:",
